From 64bb986813fc95f6277125510c54309c3e9b570c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 23:26:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] feat(rfork): expose tensor layout and startup diagnostics
 at info

Log endpoint tensor shape, stride, NPU format, logical byte count, storage byte capacity and physical descriptor element count with transfer-session correlation. Keep packed dtype-view storage counts in their native units and tolerate unavailable diagnostic APIs.

Promote startup, transfer, lease outcome and seed publication diagnostics to INFO on every rank. Document fields and correlation in English and Chinese without changing planner or transfer semantics.

Validation: 298 CPU-isolated RFork tests passed; Ruff, markdownlint, codespell, typos and source checks passed. NPU hardware and the full vLLM runtime were unavailable.
Signed-off-by: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
(cherry picked from commit eba5fdc822ca350d8fbef1440b4804c69def9def)

Backport validation on v0.26.0rc1: 237 CPU-isolated tests passed (the counts above describe source-branch validation). Resolve conflicts while preserving legacy AscendMoERunner/hardware APIs, acquire-before-registration ordering and optional manifest metadata. Add seed lifecycle locking required by heartbeat health checks and validate optional metadata for checkpoint seed supersets. Ruff, Markdown, spelling, translation and source checks passed; full vLLM/NPU/RDMA validation remains unavailable.

Signed-off-by: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
