-msgid "Loading summaries are INFO on TP rank 0 of each group and DEBUG on other ranks. Their elapsed time covers that worker's loader call, including any failed RFork attempt, local fallback, and synchronous seed-service startup; it is not the maximum across ranks or time until the engine is ready, and does not wait for deferred seed promotion to finish. Set `VLLM_LOGGING_LEVEL=DEBUG` before startup to inspect per-rank initialization, layout, registration, metadata, read, lease release, and seed publication details. Normal deferred seed publication is DEBUG; failures remain WARNING/ERROR on every rank."
-msgstr "加载汇总在每组 TP rank 0 使用 INFO，其他 rank 使用 DEBUG。汇总耗时覆盖该 worker 的加载器调用，包括失败的 RFork 尝试、本地回退和同步 seed 服务启动；它不是跨 rank 最大耗时，也不是引擎就绪耗时，且不会等待延迟 seed 发布完成。启动前设置 `VLLM_LOGGING_LEVEL=DEBUG` 可查看各 rank 的初始化、布局处理、注册、元数据获取、读取、租约释放和 seed 发布细节。正常延迟发布 seed 使用 DEBUG，各 rank 的失败仍保留 WARNING/ERROR。"
+msgid "Loading summaries and startup stage diagnostics are INFO on every rank. Their elapsed time covers that worker's loader call, including any failed RFork attempt, local fallback, and synchronous seed-service startup; it is not the maximum across ranks or time until the engine is ready, and does not wait for deferred seed promotion to finish. The default INFO level includes per-rank initialization, layout, registration, metadata/read timings, lease outcomes, and seed publication or deferral. Successful periodic heartbeats and individual transfer-chunk progress remain DEBUG; failures remain WARNING/ERROR on every rank."
+msgstr "所有 rank 均以 INFO 记录加载摘要和启动阶段诊断。其总耗时覆盖该 worker 的加载器调用，包括失败的 RFork 尝试、本地回退和同步 seed 服务启动；它不是跨 rank 最大耗时，也不是引擎就绪时间，且不会等待延迟 seed 晋升完成。默认 INFO 级别包含各 rank 的初始化、布局处理、注册、元数据/读取耗时、租约结果，以及 seed 发布或延迟发布。周期性成功心跳和逐传输块进度仍为 DEBUG；所有 rank 的失败仍为 WARNING/ERROR。"
 
 msgid "Fallback restores the Ascend MoE layer registry and layer counter, as well as the compilation registries and rotary cache, to their pre-attempt state. This releases discarded expert weights before checkpoint loading, including after partial model construction, while preserving an already loaded target model when a draft attempt fails."
